nt_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible since #97745 / [88e6997917236276cc49d76fbb90d3e8cd26fd4f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev.mono (88e699791) - Ubuntu 24.04.1 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a `SubViewport` with `size_2d_override` and `size_2d_override_stetch` the resulting texture is scaled in the ratio _size / override-size_.\n\nAs an example, setting the `SubViewport`'s size to 100x100 and the the override to 25x25 results in a texture of the size 400x400 instead of the expected 100x100.\n\nAdditionally, the following warning is printed in the output when using a `SubViewport` without a `SubViewportContainer`:\n\n```\nW 0:00:00:0360   get_screen_transform_internal: SubViewport is not a child of a SubViewportContainer. get_screen_transform doesn't return the actual screen position.\n  <C++ Source>   scene/main/viewport.cpp:5221 @ get_screen_transform_internal()\n```\n\nMy tests show that it was introduced by #97745 / [88e6997917236276cc49d76fbb90d3e8cd26fd4f].\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe MRP contains a `SubViewport` with a `ColorRect` of size 25x25. The `SubViewport`s size is set to 100x100, `size_2d_override` to 25x25 and `size_2d_override_stretch` to `true`. \nThe `ViewportTexture` is displayed in a `Sprite2D`. With this setup the sprite is 400x400 instead of the expected 100x100.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18293423/mrp.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101039/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}